1. d4 {P69 was the second preliminary section in which Franklin played; it started in late 1986 and the start-list can be seen in the BPCF IC Feb 1987 p28. I was playing multiple sections to try out opening ideas. The other players in this section were S. A. Jones, L. Holroyd, J. Canton, W. F. Lumley and P. G. Day.} Nc6 2. Nf3 d5 3. e3 Bg4 4. Be2 Nf6 5. c4 e6 6. Nc3 Bd6 7. O-O dxc4 8. Qa4 a6 9. Qxc4 O-O 10. Rd1 Qe7 11. e4 e5 12. d5 Bxf3 13. dxc6 Bxe2 14. Nxe2 b5 15. Qc2 Qe6 16. b3 Rfb8 17. f3 a5 18. Ng3 a4 19. Bb2 Ra6 20. Rac1 axb3 21. axb3 Ra2 22. Ra1 Rxb2 23. Qxb2 Bc5+ 24. Kh1 Bd4 25. Rxd4 exd4 26. Qxd4 Qxc6 27. Nf5 Re8 28. b4 g6 29. Ne3 Re6 30. e5 Nd7 31. f4 Qb6 32. Rd1 Qxd4 33. Rxd4 Nb6 34. Rd8+ Kg7 35. Ng4 Rc6 36. g3 Rc4 37. Nf6 h5 38. Kg2 Rxb4 39. Kh3 Nc4 40. g4 $1 hxg4+ 41. Kh4 Nd2 42. Rxd2 Rxf4 43. Rd8 b4 44. Rg8+ Kh6 45. Nxg4+ Kh7 46. Rc8 1-0

